  "neighborhoods": "Potrero Hill, Southeast San Francisco",
  "description_text": "Exceptional upside potential in Potrero Hill. This home sits on a huge 5,800 sq. ft. parcel along with the adjacent property located at 1101 Rhode Island St (APN# 4159-051). Both properties must be sold together. These two detached homes with separate addresses and separate APNs offer a rare opportunity for developers, contractors, investors, owner-users, multi-generational living, or buyers with vision seeking long-term value creation. This spacious home features 2 bedrooms, 2 baths, a living room, kitchen, family room, and a rear narrow room, all conveniently located on a single level. Additional features include very high ceilings, tall windows, abundant natural light, a rear patio, an unfinished basement, and views toward Sutro Tower. Both homes (1107 and 1101 Rhode Island St) are in livable condition but would benefit from cosmetic updating for owner-occupants. These homes are ideally located within walking distance of Zuckerberg San Francisco General Hospital, Muni transit, and with convenient access to Whole Foods, restaurants, Downtown SF, and Highways 101 and 280, providing easy access East Bay and South Bay. This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. Buyers are advised to conduct their own investigations regarding development potential and the highest and best use of the property. Build or Renovate and They Will Come.",
